  "releaseNotes": "- PDDateTimeOffset: added an optional \"Now\" mode and named time zone selection. ShowNow renders a checkbox that, when checked, follows the live clock (value refreshed every LiveUpdateIntervalMs and the inputs disabled); unchecking lets the user pin a fixed instant. IsNow is bindable with @bind-IsNow. ShowTimeZones replaces the numeric UTC-offset selector with the full set of system time zones (TimeZoneInfo.GetSystemTimeZones()), deriving the value's offset from the selected zone with daylight saving applied; the selected zone is bindable with @bind-TimeZoneId. The numeric offset selector (ShowOffset) now also shows a representative time zone name next to each offset, and can now select UTC (+00:00), which was previously ignored. All new parameters default to off, so existing usage is unchanged. The component now implements IDisposable to clean up the live-update timer.",
